# MongoDB Atlas Connection Monitor

This extension collects and displays MongoDB Atlas authentication and connection metrics.

## Metrics included
- Authentication success/failure counts
- Connection accepted and ended counts
- Duration metrics in microseconds

## Configuration
Provide your Atlas API public and private keys, group ID, and cluster name in the activation schema.

